# Muldrotha's ways are its controller's ("During each of your turns, you may ... from your graveyard"): on its own turn 2 Bot2
# sacrifices its Black Lotus and may not cast it back from its graveyard by Bot1's Muldrotha, though it is Bot2's turn and the
# Lotus is an artifact card in its owner's graveyard. On turn 3 Bot1 casts its own sacrificed Black Lotus by the artifact way.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Muldrotha, the Gravetide
Thought Scour
Forest
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island x23

